		{"id":"514da6be40324e83","type":"text","text":"> [!Welcome]\n> Click the tree links below to explore the tech trees of the different factions.\n> \n> Check the MOC (Maps of Content) folder for different ways to view info.\n> \n> Tags can be used to search for specific stuff.\n> \n> Use Ctrl+O to open cards with fuzzy finding.\n> \n> This is all very much W.I.P..\n> \n> Get the latest version with [git](https://gitlab.com/dow4-vault/DoW4-Obsidian).\n> Best viewed with [Obsidian](https://obsidian.md/).\n> -- Artist","x":-390,"y":-1484,"width":425,"height":432}
